      "id": "f8960014-cfce-4118-b276-425d9cda9fa8",
      "name": "Payments",
      "description": {
        "content": "The Payments resource provides methods that allow you to manage payments for an account.\n\nThese calls can only be used by users with account administrator privileges.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
